  "releaseNotes": "https://www.cepheis.com/hiperspace/20260830\n# Overview\n\nThis release contains minor updates following **Hiperspace.DB** testing is **ISO20022** spaces.\n\n## value segment/aspect validation\nAdded addition validation that Values cannot include Segments or Aspects, since they do not have a global identifier\n\n## Parallel scan enhancement\nIn Hiperspace any stored element {entity, segment, aspect, view} can provide  **view** projections to new the element; when the view is queried every element is projects the view is queried in parallel, potentially resulting in hundreds of parallel searches to different `SetSpaces<>`, the  *Hiperspace.DB*  query `from n in graph.Nodes select n;` will search every database on the server, and almost every element within the database.  This release changes the number of concurent request sent to the C++ gRpc server to prevent ENHANCE_YOUR_CALM errors under load.\n\n---\n## Referenced libraries\nExternal references have been updated to the latest version",
